 "remarks": "Situated within the private Davenport Point waterfront association, this classic shingle-style Colonial offers 5,745 sq. ft. on .42 acres, with five bedrooms, four full and two half baths, and a three-car garage. High ceilings, custom millwork, hardwood floors, and two indoor fireplaces complement gracious living and dining rooms. The eat-in kitchen features granite countertops and a center island. Upstairs, two distinct wings offer privacy, including a spacious primary suite with two walk-in closets. A finished third-floor recreation room adds flexibility. French doors open to a stone terrace with an outdoor fireplace and built-in spa, framed by mature landscaping. Enjoy association beach and dock access on Long Island Sound, minutes from Old Greenwich Village, Stamford, and Metro-North.",
